uum|v|To give a gift or gifts. ; To yield to force or pressure; to relax; to become less rigid; as, the earth gives under the feet. ; To become soft or moist. ; To move; to recede. ; To shed tears; to weep. ; To have a misgiving. ; To open; to lead.	o:2881,8,3~2881,8,3	d:1loz,16,4;1e0i,8,6;2cj,5,7;1431,2,6~2cj,5,7;1e0i,8,6;1431,2,6;1loz,16,4	D:2881,3,2~2881,3,2
